Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.html
RewriteEngine On
RewriteBase /
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} -f [OR]
RewriteCond %{REQUEST_FILENAME} -d
RewriteRule ^ - [L]
RewriteRule ^(roles|privacy|features|download|user-guide|roadmap|use-cases|why-it-matters|faq|contact|career|team|about|schools|terms|delete-account|legal/privacy-policy|legal/terms|legal/disclaimer)/?$ /index.html [L]
